      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los chacales rondaban el borde del desierto, donde se enterraba a los muertos en la arena.",
          "en": "Jackals roamed the edge of the desert, where the dead were buried in the sand."
        },
        {
          "es": "Muchos estudiosos creen que los egipcios pusieron como guardián al animal que amenazaba las tumbas.",
          "en": "Many scholars think the Egyptians made the animal that threatened the tombs into their guardian."
        },
        {
          "es": "Anubis era negro. Pero el negro no era el color de la muerte.",
          "en": "Anubis was black. But black was not the color of death."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era el color de la tierra fértil que deja el Nilo, y de la vida que vuelve a nacer.",
          "en": "It was the color of the rich soil the Nile leaves behind, and of life being born again."
        }
