      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Anubis era el dios de los embalsamadores, los que preparaban las momias.",
          "en": "Anubis was the god of the embalmers, the people who prepared mummies."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ya vimos cómo hizo la primera momia con el cuerpo de Osiris.",
          "en": "We already saw how he made the first mummy from the body of Osiris."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde entonces, cada embalsamador trabajaba en su nombre. Algunos creen que un sacerdote usaba una máscara de chacal.",
          "en": "Since then, every embalmer worked in his name. Some historians think a priest wore a jackal mask."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus títulos incluían 'El que está sobre su montaña' y 'Señor de la tierra sagrada'.",
          "en": "His titles included 'He Who Is Upon His Mountain' and 'Lord of the Sacred Land'."
        }
